BT 1 0 0 1 0 47.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 14.5 TL -0.0411 Tw (JobDesk CRM is a Windows program built for people who handle recruiting and hiring: it manages) Tj T* 0 Tw (a candidate's entire journey, from first contact to hire, with no monthly subscription and no need) Tj T* (for a constant internet connection. All your data stays on your own PC. \(If you still see the name) Tj T* (\223Recruiter CRM\224 in the installer file, it is the same program: it has simply been renamed.\)) Tj T* ET
